      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "If PyUnicodeWriter_WriteUTF8() or PyUnicodeWriter_Format() fails, the writer should remain valid and usable for further writes. These functions can change the buffer kind to support write larger character. But if these functions fail, PyUnicodeWriter_Finish() may need to change the buffer kind to use the most efficient storage for the final string.\n\n<!-- gh-linked-prs -->\n### Linked PRs\n* gh-158442\n<!-- /gh-linked-prs -->\n",
